    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Description",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Join the architects behind Plaistow Hub for a 45-minute guided tour of this landmark regeneration project centred on Plaistow Underground Station. Discover how 182 new homes, a public square, library, community facilities and active ground-floor uses have transformed the area into a vibrant new local centre. The tour will explore design approach, place-making ambitions and the role architecture."
            ]
